WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.705
Spin glasses with rotation invariant couplings.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.769
Pick any spectrum, then rotate it by a random orthogonal matrix.

3
00:00:06.919 --> 00:00:10.327
The couplings stop being independent, which broke all the usual tools.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.013
Claimed: an explicit free energy formula at every temperature.

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.064
Checked in Lean.
